# ============================================================
# Mind Palette - Repo root .gitignore
# Focus: C++ / CMake / Visual Studio generated artifacts
# ============================================================

# --- Visual Studio / MSVC (generated) ---
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln
*.VC.db
*.VC.VC.opendb

# Old VS CMake settings (per-user/machine)
CMakeSettings.json
CMakeUserPresets.json

# --- CMake / Ninja (generated) ---
CMakeFiles/
CMakeCache.txt
cmake_install.cmake
CTestTestfile.cmake
Testing/
build.ninja
.ninja_deps
.ninja_log
compile_commands.json

# Visual Studio "Open Folder" CMake output (generated)
out/
preprocess-server/out/
shared_volume/

# vcpkg install roots created inside build trees (generated)
vcpkg_installed/

# --- C/C++ build artifacts (generated) ---
*.o
*.obj
*.lo
*.a
*.lib
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.exe
*.pdb
*.idb
*.ilk
*.exp
*.iobj
*.ipdb
*.tlog
*.pch
*.res
*.manifest

# --- OS / Explorer noise ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- logs ---
**/logs/
*.log
*_error.txt
*.vcxproj
*.filters
*.recipe
*.json

JOB_SEARCH_STRATEGY.md
INTERVIEW_PREP_GUIDE.md
현재 경력 기술서.md
*.jpg
SKILL.md
# Antigravity/Claude 스킬 파일은 추적 필요
!.agent/skills/**/SKILL.md
!.claude/skills/**/SKILL.md

# --- Python (ai-server) ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
ai-server/models/

# --- Legacy backup files ---
*.bak
